# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE ALL-IN-ONE TOOLS WEBSITE

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, modern, professional, responsive, and production-ready All-in-One Online Tools Website.

The website must provide useful tools for image editing, PDF processing, text manipulation, calculations, unit conversion, developer utilities, SEO, color design, social media content creation, date and time calculations, random generators, and file conversion.

The website must work without:
- API keys.
- A dedicated backend server.
- A database.
- User registration or login.
- Paid third-party services.
- Secret environment variables.
- External AI services.

All tools must process data directly in the user's browser whenever technically possible.

The website will be hosted on Vercel through a GitHub repository import.

IMPORTANT: Do not create a mockup, static demonstration, or incomplete prototype. Build a functional website with working tools and real calculations.

