The website must look professional on both mobile devices and desktop computers.

## 3. REQUIRED TECHNOLOGY STACK

Use the following technologies:

- React.
- Vite.
- JavaScript or TypeScript.
- CSS.
- Browser-native Web APIs.
- Lightweight client-side JavaScript libraries when necessary.

Choose compatible, stable library versions.

The application must be a client-side website.

Do not create:
- Next.js API routes.
- Server Actions.
- Express servers.
- Backend endpoints.
- Database integrations.
- Authentication systems.
- API key configuration screens.
- Server-side file-processing services.
- Unnecessary environment variables.

Do not use AI APIs.

Do not use Firebase, Supabase, MongoDB, or other databases.

